1
0:00:00,000 --> 0:00:05,000
让我用这个洞来收集尽可能多的木头

2
0:00:00,000 --> 0:00:05,000
Let me use this hole right here to collect as many logs as I can.

3
0:00:05,000 --> 0:00:11,000
之后我们就能把洞升级到下一级，但在此之前，再多放一些进去

4
0:00:05,000 --> 0:00:11,000
After that, we will be able to upgrade our hole to the next level, but to do that, let me get some more inside.

5
0:00:11,000 --> 0:00:13,000
我觉得我们进展得挺顺利的

6
0:00:11,000 --> 0:00:13,000
I think we are doing really good.

7
0:00:13,000 --> 0:00:15,500
这些木头都要运到我们的公司去

8
0:00:13,000 --> 0:00:15,500
All of these logs are going to our company.

9
0:00:15,500 --> 0:00:18,500
收集完木头后，就该去公司帮忙了

10
0:00:15,500 --> 0:00:18,500
So, after collecting as many logs as we can, it's time to move to the company and help them.

11
0:00:18,500 --> 0:00:25,000
首先要去掉树皮，然后把木头加工成优质木板

12
0:00:18,500 --> 0:00:25,000
First thing first, we have to remove the bark from the trees and we will be able to turn those logs into really good planks.

13
0:00:25,000 --> 0:00:30,500
现在把木板装上卡车，最后送给外面等候的猫咪们

14
0:00:25,000 --> 0:00:30,500
Now, we can load all of those planks into our truck and finally, we will be able to deliver them to the cats waiting outside.

15
0:00:30,500 --> 0:00:35,000
这样我们就能赚到升级公司所需的全部资金

16
0:00:30,500 --> 0:00:35,000
That's how we are going to make all the money we need to upgrade our company to the next level.

